.TH SWIFT-TOUCH-KDE-SETTINGS 1 "April 2026" "swift-touch-kde 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
swift-touch-kde-settings \- graphical settings app for Swift Touch KDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swift-touch-kde-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts the PyQt settings window to monitor and manage
\fBswift-touch-media.service\fR, inspect device access, and open service logs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swift-touch-kde (1),
.BR swift-touch-kde-user-setup (1)
